  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Nabe is table cooking at its most relaxed. A pot of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "nabe broth",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "nabe-broth"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " simmers in the middle of the table and everyone adds ingredients and lifts them out as they cook. Dip everything in "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ponzu",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "ponzu"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " before eating. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The broth deepens and becomes richer as the meal progresses. At the end, add cooked rice or udon noodles to the remaining broth to make a final small soup."
          }
        ]
      },
